  "premise_review": [
    "The entire AdelicBase is concrete typed data: one Place with an equality to its distinguished constructor, a List Place, and a complete forall-membership existential constructor condition. No field is dropped.",
    "The complete defaultAdelicBase chooses the distinguished constructor and an empty finitePlaces list; includesArchimedean is rfl and finitePlaceSound discharges impossible empty-list membership by cases. These are actual supplied proof terms, preserved exactly.",
    "The original Place provider is an archimedean constructor plus finite : Nat -> Place, not a constructed adelic space, valuation or prime-only type. finitePlaceSound supplies a Nat constructor witness without requiring Nat.Prime. Original import identity remains unchanged; the new326 copies are not substituted."
  ],
